    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>danger</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="51.09182988784432" lon="-115.36786262506865">
    <name>Limited Services</name>
    <cmt>caution</cmt>
    <desc>Note that services including food stops on the route are limited for the next 175km until Turner/Diamond Valley. Don't leave Canmore without adequate supplies.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>danger</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="51.1896569048049" lon="-115.51980997198348">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders can choose to stay on Tunnel Mountain road here instead of taking this mountain bike trail option</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="50.69533903356668" lon="-115.13556827225638">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders can choose to take this gravel road (Smith Dorian Trail - 742) all the way to Canmore instead of High Rockies trail option. Road can be rough and dusty with fair amount of traffic.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="51.06292999496492" lon="-115.42994566609524">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders can bypass Banff by turning on trail here and going on main road (742) to Canmoore </desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="50.04994876883862" lon="-110.76638545229214">
